--- inputrc
set search-ignore-case on
"\C-xp": history-search-backward
"\C-xs": history-substring-search-backward
--- script
add_history "ÉTÉ chaud"
readline "> "
=== prefix
--- keys
été\C-xp<dump>\r
=== substring
--- keys
té\C-xs<dump>\r
=== isearch
--- keys
\C-rété\C-j<dump>\r
=== noninc
--- keys
\M-pété\r<dump>\r
